@startuml Outbound History

title 取得出庫歷程（總管理者：全部倉庫可篩選 AdminOnly；倉庫管理者＋一般員工：限自己倉庫 WarehouseStaffOnly）—— 訂單層級，不攤開、不做加總

actor "總管理者" as Admin
actor "倉庫管理者 / 一般員工" as Staff

box "Ordering.Api" #LightBlue
    participant "ListOutboundHistoryEndpoint" as AdminEndpoint
    participant "ListWarehouseOutboundHistoryEndpoint" as StaffEndpoint
    participant "ICurrentUser" as CurrentUser
end box

box "Ordering.Application" #LightYellow
    participant "ISender" as Sender
    participant "ListOutboundHistoryQueryHandler" as Handler
end box

box "Ordering.Infrastructure" #WhiteSmoke
    participant "IOutboundOrderReader" as Reader
end box

database "ordering_db" as DB

== 總管理者：GET /api/v1/outbound/history?warehouseId=&completedFrom=&...  ==
Admin -> AdminEndpoint : （warehouseId 可為 null，代表查全部倉庫）
AdminEndpoint -> Sender : SendAsync(ListOutboundHistoryQuery(warehouseId, ...))

== 倉庫管理者／一般員工：GET /api/v1/outbound/history/warehouse?... ==
Staff -> StaffEndpoint : （不接受 warehouseId 參數）
StaffEndpoint -> CurrentUser : WarehouseId
StaffEndpoint -> Sender : SendAsync(ListOutboundHistoryQuery(currentUser.WarehouseId, ...))

Sender -> Handler : HandleAsync(query, ct)
Handler -> Reader : ListHistoryAsync(warehouseId, completedFrom, completedTo,\nproductNo, productName, unit, requestedBy, confirmedBy, ct)

Reader -> DB : select 訂單層級一列一張單\nfrom outbound_orders\nwhere status in ('Confirmed','Rejected')  -- 只顯示已處理的\n  and (@WarehouseId is null or warehouse_id = @WarehouseId)\n  and （其餘篩選條件皆為 optional）
DB --> Reader : rows（沒有分頁，也沒有 count(*) over()）
Reader --> Handler : IReadOnlyList<OutboundHistoryDto>
Handler --> Sender : Result.Success
Sender --> Admin : 200 OK
Sender --> Staff : 200 OK

note over Reader, DB
  跟入庫歷程（inbound-history.puml）刻意不同：
  文件第5章「取得出庫歷程」只要求訂單層級的清單
  （出庫單id/編號/倉庫/申請時間/完成時間/申請人/審核人），
  不需要攤開成品項、也不需要加總金額 ——
  要看某張單的品項明細，走 query-outbound.puml
  裡的「取得出庫明細」。
end note

@enduml
